    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to your first step toward building a hosting empire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i>Ping Profit Demo</i>, you\u2019ll start your web hosting journey in a cramped basement with just a few budget servers and limited resources. Master the basics of running a successful hosting business\u2014buy servers, manage heat, keep your customers online, and solve problems before they turn into disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is just the beginning. The full game will take you beyond the basement, allowing you to expand into warehouses and high-tech data centers. Your dream of dominating the hosting industry starts here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play (Demo Walkthrough)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Servers:</strong> Start with basic desktop rigs and place them strategically in your basement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/96b61089dca4ee390857a1af1ebcbfcd.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/a1203595787bf091dff6fae02468377d.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Power and Cooling:</strong> Balance power usage and install cooling units to prevent overheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/2ced351759202eccd11214000b8a472f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/da5e5a1a001272793676b759cb863d8a.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Customers Online:</strong> Monitor server performance, handle breakdowns, and maintain uptime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/1ac2d95327dd4d80cac525266569cf0d.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/51d06647c89e838b69d54610e66dd4f8.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Profits:</strong> Optimize your setup, earn revenue, and reinvest in better equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/fe3a73e5feed1cc0f428be83956c2e7b.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/356c57b029c876d89efdd04a23b69e3e.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire or Terminate Employees:</strong> Bring on staff to help manage servers and automate tasks\u2014or let them go when they\u2019re no longer needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Migrate:</strong> Halt services on aging servers, migrate customers to new hardware, and replace outdated equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/67be34d495dcd11644c2123b5217af55.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to test your skills and see if you can keep your business afloat? Try the <i>Ping Profit Demo</i> now, and wishlist the full game for even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f <strong>Thank you for checking out <i>Ping Profit</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured our passion into creating this game, and we hope you love playing it as much as we\u2019ve loved making it. Your support means everything \u2014 it directly fuels our ability to expand, improve, and make <i>Ping Profit</i> even better. With your continued support, you'll be part of our journey, helping us bring new features, content, and surprises to life. Check out our Early Access Plans, Full Game Details, and Post Launch Roadmap below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Join the journey to tech domination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist <i>Ping Profit</i> now and shape the future with us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/e2b5d135ed54baa5514e82549d70b368.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Next?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Join Us in Early Access!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ping Profit</i> will be doing an\u00a0<strong>Early Access</strong>, and we want you to be part of the journey! This isn\u2019t just a chance to play the game early \u2014 it\u2019s an opportunity to help shape its future. Your feedback, ideas, and support will directly influence the final game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 What\u2019s Planned for the Full Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scale Up Your Business:</strong> Move beyond the cramped basement and establish large-scale operations in Warehouses and Data Centers. Design efficient layouts, optimize server placement, and manage sprawling server facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your servers with advanced hardware, better management software, and efficient cooling solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee Management:</strong> Hire and manage a team of skilled employees. Assign roles, automate tasks, optimize productivity, and keep your staff motivated and efficient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Tech Tree:</strong> Use the Tech Tree to unlock automation, advanced employee training, server management improvements, cost-cutting techniques, and more. Customize your strategy for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/80572f1847506a2da126ed1a6474c89f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Mini-Games:</strong> Test your skills with interactive mini-games. Manage outages, repair or rebuild servers, troubleshoot cabling issues, and keep your data center running smoothly. Stay sharp under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/ea2e83c3daa48454dc703a65672b8425.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Post-Launch Roadmap Editions for <i>Ping Profit</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for even more ways to grow your hosting empire! Our Post-Launch Roadmap introduces three major editions that will transform how you manage your business, compete in the industry, and explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d6bfb30338ad09d4dae9b4160adbec9f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Employee Edition </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Employee Types:</strong> Hire new specialists with unique skills and assign them to key roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Management:</strong> Train employees, adjust pay, and maintain staff morale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Management:</strong> Give your team the rest they need without disrupting productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Upgrades:</strong> Provide employees with better tools for faster, more efficient task completion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Rivals Edition </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Gameplay:</strong> Compete directly against rival hosting companies, each with their own strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliances and Deals:</strong> Forge partnerships with other companies or undercut your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Market:</strong> Adapt to a constantly changing industry with shifting client demands and rival tactics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Open World Expansion </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore New Locations:</strong> Move beyond your current region and explore a world of potential locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional Pricing:</strong> Set custom prices for hosting services based on location, adjusting for regional costs and demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Placement:</strong> Choose and purchase new properties in different regions for optimized performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional Bonuses:</strong> Each location comes with unique challenges and benefits \u2014 from low-cost energy to high-demand markets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Manage logistics, optimize server placement, and take advantage of regional perks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for more updates as we continue expanding Ping Profit! Got a feature you\u2019d love to see? Let us know in the community discussions or post in our Feedback form. \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to your first step toward building a hosting empire!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i>Ping Profit Demo</i>, you\u2019ll start your web hosting journey in a cramped basement with just a few budget servers and limited resources. Master the basics of running a successful hosting business\u2014buy servers, manage heat, keep your customers online, and solve problems before they turn into disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is just the beginning. The full game will take you beyond the basement, allowing you to expand into warehouses and high-tech data centers. Your dream of dominating the hosting industry starts here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/7930bfad15281526ee27234175bdd2fc.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play (Demo Walkthrough)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Servers:</strong> Start with basic desktop rigs and place them strategically in your basement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/96b61089dca4ee390857a1af1ebcbfcd.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/a1203595787bf091dff6fae02468377d.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Power and Cooling:</strong> Balance power usage and install cooling units to prevent overheating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/2ced351759202eccd11214000b8a472f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/da5e5a1a001272793676b759cb863d8a.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Customers Online:</strong> Monitor server performance, handle breakdowns, and maintain uptime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/1ac2d95327dd4d80cac525266569cf0d.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/51d06647c89e838b69d54610e66dd4f8.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Profits:</strong> Optimize your setup, earn revenue, and reinvest in better equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/fe3a73e5feed1cc0f428be83956c2e7b.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/356c57b029c876d89efdd04a23b69e3e.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire or Terminate Employees:</strong> Bring on staff to help manage servers and automate tasks\u2014or let them go when they\u2019re no longer needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d066c41b59bd14900f62416d7ac8b825.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Migrate:</strong> Halt services on aging servers, migrate customers to new hardware, and replace outdated equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/67be34d495dcd11644c2123b5217af55.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to test your skills and see if you can keep your business afloat? Try the <i>Ping Profit Demo</i> now, and wishlist the full game for even greater challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f <strong>Thank you for checking out <i>Ping Profit</i>!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured our passion into creating this game, and we hope you love playing it as much as we\u2019ve loved making it. Your support means everything \u2014 it directly fuels our ability to expand, improve, and make <i>Ping Profit</i> even better. With your continued support, you'll be part of our journey, helping us bring new features, content, and surprises to life. Check out our Early Access Plans, Full Game Details, and Post Launch Roadmap below!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Join the journey to tech domination!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Wishlist <i>Ping Profit</i> now and shape the future with us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/e2b5d135ed54baa5514e82549d70b368.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Next?</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Join Us in Early Access!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ping Profit</i> will be doing an\u00a0<strong>Early Access</strong>, and we want you to be part of the journey! This isn\u2019t just a chance to play the game early \u2014 it\u2019s an opportunity to help shape its future. Your feedback, ideas, and support will directly influence the final game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 What\u2019s Planned for the Full Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scale Up Your Business:</strong> Move beyond the cramped basement and establish large-scale operations in Warehouses and Data Centers. Design efficient layouts, optimize server placement, and manage sprawling server facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Upgrades:</strong> Enhance your servers with advanced hardware, better management software, and efficient cooling solutions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.poster.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.webm?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/404ac9c01d5211f2bc8ae764bc83d6a1.mp4?t=1753398780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Employee Management:</strong> Hire and manage a team of skilled employees. Assign roles, automate tasks, optimize productivity, and keep your staff motivated and efficient.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Tech Tree:</strong> Use the Tech Tree to unlock automation, advanced employee training, server management improvements, cost-cutting techniques, and more. Customize your strategy for maximum efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/80572f1847506a2da126ed1a6474c89f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Mini-Games:</strong> Test your skills with interactive mini-games. Manage outages, repair or rebuild servers, troubleshoot cabling issues, and keep your data center running smoothly. Stay sharp under pressure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/ea2e83c3daa48454dc703a65672b8425.avif?t=1753398780\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude80 Post-Launch Roadmap Editions for <i>Ping Profit</i> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for even more ways to grow your hosting empire! Our Post-Launch Roadmap introduces three major editions that will transform how you manage your business, compete in the industry, and explore the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605560/extras/d6bfb30338ad09d4dae9b4160adbec9f.avif?t=1753398780\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Employee Edition </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Employee Types:</strong> Hire new specialists with unique skills and assign them to key roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Management:</strong> Train employees, adjust pay, and maintain staff morale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break Management:</strong> Give your team the rest they need without disrupting productivity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tool Upgrades:</strong> Provide employees with better tools for faster, more efficient task completion.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Rivals Edition </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Gameplay:</strong> Compete directly against rival hosting companies, each with their own strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliances and Deals:</strong> Forge partnerships with other companies or undercut your competitors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Market:</strong> Adapt to a constantly changing industry with shifting client demands and rival tactics.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 Open World Expansion </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore New Locations:</strong> Move beyond your current region and explore a world of potential locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional Pricing:</strong> Set custom prices for hosting services based on location, adjusting for regional costs and demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Placement:</strong> Choose and purchase new properties in different regions for optimized performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regional Bonuses:</strong> Each location comes with unique challenges and benefits \u2014 from low-cost energy to high-demand markets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong> Manage logistics, optimize server placement, and take advantage of regional perks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for more updates as we continue expanding Ping Profit! Got a feature you\u2019d love to see? Let us know in the community discussions or post in our Feedback form. \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "short_description": "Launch your hosting company straight from your parent's basement! Buy servers, solve problems, and grow your profits as you climb from startup to tech titan. Keep customers online, boost your reputation, and build the ultimate hosting empire in Ping Profit!",
